other user accounts

10
00:00:27,234 --> 00:00:30,064
(Raj:)so I can post positive
comments about their paper.

11
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:33,100
"This wee li'l bairn
of a theory

12
00:00:33,106 --> 00:00:35,206
nearly blew my kilt off"?

13
00:00:35,208 --> 00:00:38,248
